1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Mo. Camping.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,233
Let's gooo!

3
00:00:03,233 --> 00:00:05,533
1 p.m., campsite B-7.

4
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:08,900
Here it is. Prime spot, once the water drains.

5
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,133
Dad, our spot is a swimming pool!

6
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:13,700
It's fine. The tent is waterproof.

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,600
Three hours later.

8
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,367
Behold. A house on the water!

9
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:17,900
…And how do we get in?

10
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:18,700
We swim.

11
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:21,300
6 p.m. Five kilos of pork belly.

12
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,767
The charcoal… is wet.

13
00:00:23,767 --> 00:00:26,267
Dad, the mosquitoes are lining up!

14
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:28,867
For the mosquitoes, a buffet just opened.

15
00:00:28,867 --> 00:00:33,000
11 p.m. The frog choir's encore.

16
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,133
Frog… I want to go home too.

17
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:38,533
In the end, the family slept in the car.

18
00:00:38,533 --> 00:00:41,133
Thanks to the gear, Dad's bed was the trunk.

19
00:00:41,133 --> 00:00:43,700
You can lie horizontally… here too.

20
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:46,033
Dad! Best ever! Let's come again!

21
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:47,800
…Next time, somewhere without frogs.

22
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:51,567
Ding. Installment one of twelve, paid.

23
00:00:51,567 --> 00:00:54,133
The other eleven, at the next fork in the road.

24
00:00:54,133 --> 00:00:57,033
Curious about the other ending? Press Do.
